权承接推演","description":"原始6631由Tsanizadai(L50)控制，MOD显式海峡6633↔6631连接其主岛，Five Grand Bridges理念叙述Tsanizadai群岛与主岛的政治交通联系。1601—1609战争和Amiratsamo成立已支撑主岛整合；本方案把同一旧王国的Afahandro并入该政治控制包络。1609是统一模型观察年，整岛同步承接与直辖层级均未确证；理念并不提供桥梁建成或岛屿转属日。该推演不依赖1820补色，关闭推测即可恢复旧控制延续。","kind":"hypothesis","stepId":"se19-int-afahandro-associated-island-1609","sourceIds":["manual:ss26-fah-src-19399ed2d17857ad","manual:sw26-col-timeline","manual:ss26-fah-src-4e077c327ae5369f","manual:se19-int-island-evidence","alignment-reasoning-e19-integrated"],"dateEvidence":{"exactYear":null,"earliest":1609,"latest":1609,"chosenYear":1609,"observedYear":1609,"dateIsHistoricalFact":false,"precision":"source-event-year-with-spatial-proposal","sourceEventYear":1609,"boundsAreProvinceTransferDates":false,"basis":"The event year is text-attested; transferring these complete EU4 polygons and identifying direct rule are not."},"geometryNote":"只影响6631原EU4省形；为政治控制包络推演，不声称直辖行政或逐省确年。旧11省主岛方案与原始投影不改。","provinceIds":[6631],"updates":[{"owner":"S77","provinceIds":[6631],"ownerStatus":"scenario"}],"relations":[],"removeRelations":[],"changedProvinceIdsByEvidence":{"reconstructed":[6631],"attested":[]},"territorialChangeProvinceIdsByEvidence":{"reconstructed":[6631],"attested":[]},"reasoning":"原始6631由Tsanizadai(L50)控制，MOD显式海峡6633↔6631连接其主岛，Five Grand Bridges理念叙述Tsanizadai群岛与主岛的政治交通联系。1601—1609战争和Amiratsamo成立已支撑主岛整合；本方案把同一旧王国的Afahandro并入该政治控制包络。1609是统一模型观察年，整岛同步承接与直辖层级均未确证；理念并不提供桥梁建成或岛屿转属日。该推演不依赖1820补色，关闭推测即可恢复旧控制延续。","alternatives":["保留L50至1819并保留1820接缝。","L50作为Amiratsamo的地方附属统治者延续；现有文本无法确定宗属法律形式。","岛屿承接晚于1609，维持未知转属窗口；没有充分资料选择另一具体年。"],"inferenceReview":{"plan":"docs/research/sarhal-east-map-20260921/adopted/e19-integrated/plan.json","sha256":"67508c9c1ff9c240199ad4e9342793ee53b6bc9dd23db72e9acb608fd7864cdd","status":"reviewed-inference","independentHistoricalProof":false}},{"id":"ssm26-fah-amezajik-succession-1609","year":1609,"title":"阿米拉察莫1609：原阿梅扎吉核心的政体承接","description":"Rasanjy出自Amezajik并在1609宣布Amiratsamo。先以Amezajik三个实际1444控制省表示